34-wall room, pair (2,0)-(6,0), command: ./orbitc 20000000 < inputs/room34.problem
Run stopped by hand at 19:31 PST after about 4 minutes, because the machine was
swapping (swap 9.9 GB of 10.7 GB used, 400 MB disk free). Resident memory had
reached 3.3 GB. At 228 bytes per state plus a 512 MB hash table, that is about
12 million states (estimate from RSS, not a logged count). The orbit was not
completed, so this run gives no verdict.
